omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PEYFXDlWwXcQ7kNvwGBR7jf&_nc_oc=AdoXRceYpiNy3f_IjVvz4ybIHVnU0DsGrt2U4Q3s48CACl5EPjj5LlZo-nbdSJ67bAU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1XaqzE8VJlZvWhWmkaiH23FAeUVuk4pUS9SWeqwHdnXQ&oe=69DF74F4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4-QHqkAm2LIQ7kNvwGXX9Q7&_nc_oc=Ado0QkDUXTy3WLx-aM6dDj4eWy-AzRmugWgq4HambhIAgWe4TWabRNAvZVIQNaFfvnk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1QhXi6t5AK5UuBHXSbWyXn_2Meo78EK8AGhrm3J65opA&oe=69DF7656"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yxc-VojiQ-MQ7kNvwG6GnFC&_nc_oc=AdqsDtshsqN88oigYSrdxN7nuMIhhV9hCYkLhIkVJe4BTkTuOl0aqEBLZPGdKbLUXek&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1qF7iIDTHrbNJIDUpMJmGMNdH0BVUQQIXw0cKQ-sUluQ&oe=69DF8B77"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://